{%- doc -%}
  The "BrewSociety." wordmark drawn as one shape, so it can run exactly edge to edge at any
  width (footer). Fill is currentColor. Size it with CSS: width 100%, height auto.

  Outlines: Marcel's "BrewSociety" from Figma Footer V2 (4317:3884), TT Commons Pro DemiBold,
  with the font's full stop added at the font's y-to-period kerning and the -0.035em display
  tracking. Text set in the browser cannot be fitted to the glyph edges, hence a shape.

  @param {string} label - Accessible name, e.g. shop.name
  @param {string} [class] - Class on the svg

  @example
  {% render 'bs-wordmark', label: shop.name, class: 'footer__wordmark' %}
{%- enddoc -%}
